<title>USA: U.S. brass mill inventories up in May - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. brass mill inventories up in May - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brass mill inventories rose to 143,798 short tons (copper content) at the end of May from 138,793 short tons in April, American Bureau of Metal Statistics said.</p>
<p>Total brass mill shipments for May dropped to 159,853 short tons from a revised total of 165,215 short tons in April. Total receipts were 103,748 short tons in the month, up from April's total of 99,557 short tons.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
